WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.870
In rural England, farming now
gives only 8 per cent of jobs.

2
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.170
How does a farm make a living now?

3
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:12.850
In India, about 12 million self-help
groups give villagers savings and loans.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.550
88 per cent are all-women.

5
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:21.170
So when farming alone no longer pays,
what keeps a countryside community alive?

6
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.630
In this mission, you'll compare
the new ways farms earn money,

7
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.930
and test which are sustainable.

8
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.010
Then you'll find out who
manages rural places,

9
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:34.490
from governments and international
bodies to charities and villagers.

10
00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:39.490
Your mission: decide what keeps a countryside
community alive when farming alone

11
00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.910
no longer pays.
